{"product_id":"grand-blue-dreaming-2","title":"Grand Blue Dreaming 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe hit comedy manga comes to print by popular demand! Swimsuits! Ramen! Dumb jokes! Beer! Uncomfortable nudity!FIRST TIMESDespite swimming about as well as a sack of hammers, Iori's been drafted into Izu University's diving club. The club's beer-soaked parties bring out his inner beast, but how will he do once he's actually underwater and face-to-face with the grandeur of the sea? And swimming ability might be the least of Iori's troubles when he awakens from the club's latest drunken revel next to a beautiful woman he doesn't recognize...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 145 x 208\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kimitake Yoshioka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781632366672\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45413373509785,"sku":"Manga-A-39781632366672","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68302a1ba9a7d-Grand-Blue-Dreaming-2-_1.jpg?v=1748277078","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/grand-blue-dreaming-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}